NAME: Backgammon

DESCRIPTION:

Play Backgammon against the CPU.  You 
are White (bottom), moving toward 
point 1. The CPU is Black (top), moving
toward 24.

Controls:
- New: opening roll; higher die plays
  first using those two numbers
- Easy / Medium / Hard: tap to cycle
  difficulty
- Status: Your Move, CPU Move, CPU Wins,
  etc.
- RstMv: after you play a checker, tap
  to undo this turn and start it over

Tap a point (or the bar) to select, 
then tap a destination or your bear-off 
tray. Hits send a blot to the bar.

No doubling cube.

CPU looks ahead one roll. Easy picks the
best move it sees immediately. Medium 
and Hard also weigh the opponent's
replies. Hard checks more moves.

NOTES:

Developed with AI assistance.
